00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:13.140
What do I do from now on...?

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.210
Koushi-dono...

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.100
Get a hold of yourself, Koushi.

00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:23.070
Old man...

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.130
Father...?

00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:26.240
Don't feel upset.

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.000
Where have you been until now?

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.660
A lot has happened over here!

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:31.670
Um.

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:33.270
"Um"?

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:34.650
Follow me.

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:40.900
I'll leave you in the hands of another person.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:42.500
"Another person"?

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:44.040
A martial artist?

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:45.580
Um.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:47.050
Well...

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:50.380
It's not exactly what you think.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:55.810
She's a woman who took care of me when I was young.

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:03.060
She is a beauty who is like an elegant yet beautiful flower blossoming under the moonlight.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:04.950
A beauty under the moonlight?

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.330
Her name is Nakajima Kimie.

00:03:07.650 --> 00:03:08.590
Eh!?

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.790
You mean her?

00:03:11.950 --> 00:03:12.450
Um.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.250
And this is your new home.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.940
This place!?

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:19.420
What?

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:21.560
I think I just heard onii-chan.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.490
I've never thought I have to live in this broken down apartment.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:33.930
A Welcome Party With Yaminabe

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:35.530
No Entry Before 7AM

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.740
No Entry Before 7AM

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:47.270
Now that we've lost our home, there is only one thing I want from you tonight.

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:50.750
Leave me alone.

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.850
I'm so useless...

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:01.680
I even tried to make seductive sounds...

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:02.940
It's open.

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.940
Koushi-dono...

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:04.470
Let's just get in.

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.050
Good morning.

00:04:07.110 --> 00:04:08.430
Let's have breakfast together.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:13.420
Koushi-dono... Koushi-dono... Koushi-dono...

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.370
Sorry for the intrusion!

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:16.970
Koushi-dono...

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:18.130
Keep the noise down.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:21.550
Breakfast!

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.150
Enjoy.

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.500
Itadakimasu!

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:27.710
I got the wrong idea, I was so surprised.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.040
I got the wrong impression too.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:34.520
But if that's the case, I still have a chance...

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:35.620
"Chance"?

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:37.570
No... That's...

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:43.060
However, I can't believe nothing is happening when you are living with the girl you like.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.130
Look who's talking.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.480
What do you want to say!?

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.400
You are cowardly and spineless.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.870
What did you say!?

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:53.510
But don't you watch her go to sleep everyday?

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:56.810
You are with her even when she changes and goes to bath, right?

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:57.850
Don't look this way.

00:04:58.380 --> 00:05:00.080
Were you only watching?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.270
Are you still a man, you loser?

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:05.450
How can you understand how I feel!?

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.830
I don't!

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:09.780
I'm jealous, dammit!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.250
Tenka-kun, you are not leaving?

00:05:16.310 --> 00:05:19.640
Yeah, I've decided to stay here.

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:20.550
That cat too?

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.680
This is my Byako.

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:22.870
Be nice to her.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:28.740
Yeah, coming.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.220
Lan... Landlord?

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.540
Eh? It's not yet the time to pay the rent...

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:35.020
Good morning, Inuzuka-kun.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:37.720
Class-rep?

00:05:38.130 --> 00:05:41.800
I brought you something for breakfast, and let me introduce to you...

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:47.230
Some of you may already know this, this is my granddaughter Sanae.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:51.060
She's just a normal girl who has no merit whatsoever. She's a normal girl, I tell ya!

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.390
You are overemphasizing, grandma.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.490
Get along with each other.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.750
Martial artist

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:58.440
Normal girl

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:00.480
The honor is ours.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:01.890
Your home...

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.650
Things must have been difficult.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:08.650
The police are investigating about the fire.

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:12.600
This is frustrating.

00:06:14.300 --> 00:06:17.310
I'll go prepare for tomorrow's dinner.

00:06:17.620 --> 00:06:18.350
Come.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:19.730
Yes.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.060
Sis.

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:26.920
Yeah, I know.

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:31.600
So what's the important thing you wanted to talk about?

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:36.180
I didn't mention this earlier, but I think I have an idea who the culprit is.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:37.620
Really?

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.070
Look.

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.490
They are unmistakably people from the western branch.

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:45.280
Assassins, right?

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:46.230
That's right.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:49.800
Please don't mention this to anyone, Momoko senpai.

00:06:50.280 --> 00:06:50.810
Yes.

00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:58.500
It'll be a big shock for Koushi-dono if he finds out that assassins are behind this, especially after he has just lost his house.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:01.110
That's why we must keep it a secret.

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:02.520
It's absolutely a secret!

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:05.000
I can hear you.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:07.420
Koushi-dono, excuse me.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.490
What is it?

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:14.230
If you don't mind, would you like to go greet everyone with me?

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.020
Okay.

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:16.990
That's common sense.

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:19.470
I did it!

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:23.430
Then let's start from Iroha-dono.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.720
We are here to say hi.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.730
It's nothing much, but please take this.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.240
I'll humbly accept.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:31.280
See you.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:32.160
Thank you.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:36.870
Living next door to onii-chan...

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.100
I'm so looking forward to this.

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:40.510
Sis.

00:07:40.630 --> 00:07:41.420
Sis!

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:42.680
What is it, Hanzo?

00:07:43.050 --> 00:07:46.820
A new tenant just moved in, we'll be having "that" tomorrow night.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:47.890
"That"!?

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:48.520
Yes...

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:50.960
Tenka-dono's room is next.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:53.850
It's not easy to make money.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.050
Byako.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.220
No pets allowed!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:08:00.790
Throw her out or make her leave, the deadline is tomorrow.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:05.340
I'll never let Byako go, we are best friends.

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:07.760
Right, Byako?

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.560
Why you little...

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:12.750
Why you...

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:14.790
Come back here, Byako!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.280
What did you do!? Get out of here!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.620
He looks busy...

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:24.750
Let's come back later.

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:25.910
You are right.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.040
There is only one room left.

00:08:28.230 --> 00:08:30.650
I wonder who lives there.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:32.340
Excuse me.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:34.100
We just moved in.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:35.920
We are here to say hi.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:44.900
I'm studying right now, so keep it short.

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:48.390
We are really sorry. My name is Kuzuryuu Momoko.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:49.800
I'm Inuzuka Koushi.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:52.310
I'm Kimogari.

00:08:52.850 --> 00:08:53.540
Kimogari?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:57.770
Translation: "Kimoi" means "disgusting", "gariben" means "study your ass off".

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:57.770
The landlord thinks my personality is disgusting, and since I'm studying really hard, that's what she named me.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.020
And my real name doesn't really matter.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:00.700
Bye.

00:09:01.570 --> 00:09:03.110
You are reading the same book as Koushi-dono.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.050
Note: It's a law book.

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:06.050
Someone like you reads Roppou Zensho?

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:07.400
Yeah.

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.360
I want to become a prosecutor.

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:15.010
Someone who wants to become a prosecutor is living together with a woman, you are pretty confident.

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:18.280
Well, a lot has happened.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.260
Are you going to take the law exam too?

00:09:21.670 --> 00:09:22.350
That's right.

00:09:22.540 --> 00:09:25.170
I'm going to take it this time.

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.500
I can feel my luck running away from me just by standing beside him.

00:09:30.180 --> 00:09:31.120
Good luck.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:32.100
Let's go.

00:09:32.320 --> 00:09:33.230
Oh, okay.

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:34.470
Wait... Koushi-dono?

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:37.220
I don't like this.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:40.720
A person who doesn't take law seriously wants to become a prosecutor...

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:41.890
I don't like this at all.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:44.820
Let me show you hell tomorrow night.

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:49.080
We are home.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:51.640
"We are home"? There is no one inside.

00:09:51.670 --> 00:09:52.650
Welcome back.

00:09:56.760 --> 00:09:58.680
Who are you?

00:09:59.050 --> 00:10:01.500
Criminal law article 130, trespassing.

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:02.400
Without a proper reason...

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.290
Lossen up.

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:06.620
We live in the same apartment.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:10.690
That's impossible!

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.760
There are only four rooms!

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:14.260
I live up there.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:14.940
Huh?

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.970
The landlord calls me Zashiki Baba.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:18.970
Translation: "Zashiki Baba" means "parlor old lady".

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:20.590
Are you a monster?

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:24.310
I come down to find food when I'm hungry.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:28.040
I'm Kuzuryuu Momoko, it's a pleasure to meet you.

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:29.920
Just drop the formality.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.410
Please get out of this room.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:34.930
So? How's your preparation for tomorrow?

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:35.800
Huh?

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.450
No one told you yet?

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:38.050
No...

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:40.010
That Nakajima...

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:46.790
Note: Yaminabe is a pot of soup where the content is brought in by all the participants.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:44.980
She would organize a yaminabe party with all the residents when a new tenant comes.

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:46.790
Yaminabe, huh?

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:50.550
It's a joy to find out what's inside.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.710
It's my first time, I'm so excited.

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.480
It's edible, right?

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:56.730
Who knows.

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.390
Everyone brings their own food.

00:11:02.950 --> 00:11:04.580
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:08.410
Grandma, is this really training?

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:17.140
Think of everything you do as a training.

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:19.340
That's how you become the best.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.720
I don't want to become the best.

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.260
Did you say something?

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:24.300
No...

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.460
The soup is coming along nicely.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:29.920
I'm so looking forward to tomorrow's yaminabe.

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.930
♪ Yaminabe, yaminabe. ♪

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.660
♪ We have yaminabe tonight. ♪

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:45.430
♪ What's going to happen if I add in my cooking? ♪

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:51.390
Why can't I do it like Momoko senpai?

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:53.900
I'll make something easier.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.860
Note: Tamagoyaki is a type of Japanese omelette.

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:57.860
I won't need any help if I'm to make tamagoyaki.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:00.370
Even I shouldn't mess it up.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.870
But now there is no originality in it.

00:12:06.430 --> 00:12:08.880
To make Koushi onii-chan happy...

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:13.590
I think I have some dried mackerel, I'm sure that'll add some taste to it.

00:12:14.470 --> 00:12:15.470
This is great too.

00:12:15.720 --> 00:12:17.830
I'll take out all the emergency food supplies.

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:19.840
It's done.

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:23.570
I've re-created the secret love potion of the Miyamoto clan, Horehanpen.

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:27.560
Now I only have to insert a strand of my hair like this.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:31.580
Whoever eats the Horehanpen will fall in love with me for one night.

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:36.230
If I put it in the yaminabe, there is no way sis will notice.

00:12:36.820 --> 00:12:38.330
If sis eats this...

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:41.600
I love you, Hanzo.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:47.430
I'll hide one of them in the laundry machine.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.980
And the other one...

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:52.270
I'll hide it inside.

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:55.410
That was some great info. Right, Byako?

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.310
If I replace it with my hair, and let Momoko eat it...

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:03.600
I love you, Tenka-dono.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:09.350
Momoko's heart will be mine!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.450
Safe

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:17.450
Dangerous

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:17.760
Just wait, Inuzuka-kun.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:22.350
I'll let you enjoy this fire spitting dumpling really soon.

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:28.120
When the victim consumes the liquid contained in one of these dumplings...

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:30.920
It'll make him spit fire from his mouth!

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:35.690
I'll be fine as long as I swallow whatever I get whole without chewing.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:45.830
I didn't want to do it because it's a lot of trouble, but I guess this is a great chance.

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:47.840
My job as an assassin, that is.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:54.870
Even though I haven't trained for a while, but if he eats this pine apple, it'll blow his head off.

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.990
Translation: "Nezu Kamen" means "Masked Mouse".

00:13:55.500 --> 00:13:58.990
Inuzuka Koushi's life now belongs to Nezu Kamen.

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:02.850
It's done.

00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:06.580
So everyone has placed their food in the pot.

00:14:07.020 --> 00:14:11.420
Look forward to what I have prepared for you.

00:14:12.140 --> 00:14:14.810
Let's have fun tonight.

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:19.680
I can't see any food inside.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.880
The color of the soup doesn't look normal...

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:28.500
My grandmother was feared at the yaminabe association as the green tongued demon.

00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:31.540
The green tongued ghost?

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:33.740
What's the yaminabe association?

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.480
Geez... the newcomers are so spineless.

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.460
Look at the other tenants.

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:41.970
Everyone is so composed.

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:49.380
In that case, the Nakajima tradition, the yaminabe party for newcomers starts now.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:51.700
Grandma...

00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.430
What's wrong? Hurry up.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.290
Please understand, Inuzuka-kun.

00:14:57.510 --> 00:14:59.640
I'm not doing this because I want to...

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:01.650
Hurry up!

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:03.600
Round one!

00:15:04.100 --> 00:15:05.480
Please join in.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:07.270
Eat up, eat up!

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:08.900
Eat up, eat up!

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:10.250
What's wrong, everyone?

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:11.570
Hurry up!

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.460
Hanzo, give it a try.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:15.090
M... M... M... Me...?

00:15:15.280 --> 00:15:16.440
Koushi-kun, what about you?

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:19.610
I think those with previous experience should go first.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:20.580
I agree.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:21.490
Me too.

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:24.450
This is the welcome party for newcomers, so you guys should go first.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:27.110
Right? Landlord's granddaughter.

00:15:27.930 --> 00:15:28.720
Eh...

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.030
Eat up, newcomers.

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:31.420
That's enough!

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:33.520
You can quit if you want.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:39.890
But then everyone will have to take the punishment of drinking the green tongued demon special, the demon soup!

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:41.590
"Punishment"!?

00:15:42.030 --> 00:15:43.280
"The demon soup"!?

00:15:43.690 --> 00:15:45.480
Don't tell me it's like this!

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.670
Don't be shy.

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.710
So what are you going to do?

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.190
I'll eat!

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:53.710
Senpai, I should go first.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:55.020
No, I will.

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:56.340
It's alright.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.380
Leave it to me.

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:01.460
No searching.

00:16:01.490 --> 00:16:04.320
And you must eat what you get.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.110
Is that understood?

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.940
This is the rice ball I made.

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.290
It tastes better than usual.

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:14.140
Told ya.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:15.280
Alright.

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:17.000
I'm next.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:18.820
It's a dumpling!

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:19.730
It looks great.

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.110
It's mine!

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:25.980
What?

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.080
What happened?

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.530
He's unconscious.

00:16:30.780 --> 00:16:33.010
Its power is just as I thought.

00:16:33.450 --> 00:16:36.500
Inuzuka Koushi, you are next.

00:16:36.880 --> 00:16:38.290
This is... spicy mix!

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.180
So that liquid killed Tenka.

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:42.900
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:46.640
I'm not dead yet...

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:48.400
Landlord.

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:50.970
There are dangerous substances in the food.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:52.420
Let's stop this right now.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:54.390
Don't be a sissy!

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:56.440
Aren't you Inuzuka Unken's son?

00:16:57.470 --> 00:17:00.200
I see someone is being really creative.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:03.280
Now I'm getting all excited.

00:17:03.660 --> 00:17:05.980
This room is now a battlefield.

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.900
Koganei Tenka, disqualified!

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.590
Round two.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:16.340
Note: Ganmo is kinda like dumpling.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:16.340
By the way, in the pot, there is my pink ganmo of happiness.

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:17.780
Huh?

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:21.580
The one who eats the pink ganmo of happiness wins.

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.880
A year's rent will be waived.

00:17:24.090 --> 00:17:26.100
A year's rent will be waived?

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.270
Let's go!

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:37.090
I have to eat as much as I can, so no harm will come to Inuzuka-kun.

00:17:37.310 --> 00:17:38.660
Even class rep...

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:40.200
I guess I have no other choice.

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:42.780
I hope I get something edible.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.130
What is this object?

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:50.310
Alright, onii-chan has my tamagoyaki.

00:17:50.780 --> 00:17:52.820
Please eat it.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:55.300
Yuck.

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:59.010
Even my tamagoyaki can't satisfy him...

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:01.990
You have the spirit.

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:04.160
Nice, sis!

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:06.640
Please take a big bite off of horehanpen!

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:10.910
Thump.

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:12.630
There it is, "thump"!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:13.790
It's a success!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.140
Sis!

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:18.350
Is this how you thought of me?

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:22.050
Sis?

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:23.500
Tenka!

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:26.040
Why did you die and leave me!?

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:28.210
Like I said, I'm not dead.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:32.000
You folded your hands, Miyamoto Iroha forfeits!

00:18:32.320 --> 00:18:33.980
Round three!

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.610
Shit...

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:39.980
So Tenka-kun was the one who stole the horehanpen in the laundry machine.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:44.120
So he likes that ponytail girl.

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:49.520
Learn some law if you have the time to be crazy about love.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:52.440
Thump.

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:53.040
What's this?

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:56.050
What's this feeling?

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.700
I feel hot just by looking at him.

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:00.700
I'm suffocating.

00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:03.210
Could this be love?

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:05.190
Don't eat that!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:06.350
No!

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.420
Double knockout!

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:16.370
Round four.

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.220
Hurry and eat.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.260
Eat up, eat up.

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:21.610
This again.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.810
I'm going to throw up if I don't eat something descent soon.

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:29.080
Well then, it's troublesome, but I think it's about time to do it.

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:34.980
At the instant he pulls his chopsticks, his concentration will be focused on the tip of his chopsticks...

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:37.620
Now is my chance!

00:19:37.840 --> 00:19:40.950
Nezu Kamen, pine apple bomb!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:42.830
What?

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:46.350
Now, Koushi-dono, eat me.

00:19:51.090 --> 00:19:53.820
That's quite an explosive taste.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:58.120
I will never forgive the person who killed Tenka!

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:01.230
I'm telling you I'm not dead!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:08.300
I should hurry up and find the pink ganmo of happiness.

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:15.670
This place is full of monsters!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.710
Zashiki Baba forfeits!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:20.630
Just shut up already!

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:25.340
Momoko-chan!

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:29.800
Double knockout!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.720
Round five.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:35.260
Let's see, so Koushi-dono is the only one left.

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:38.000
Then let's end this by calling it my victory.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:38.940
No!

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:42.110
You now have to duel with me.

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:45.660
See which one of us gets the pink ganmo of happiness first.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.320
Whatever it takes to end this pointless battle, I guess.

00:20:48.510 --> 00:20:50.710
That's what Unken's son should say.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:53.160
Get ready.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:21:01.040
Just to let you know, the green tongued demon's aim is perfect.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:17.400
You were aiming at my chopsticks, weren't you?

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.030
Your aim is perfect, didn't you say so?

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:22.110
As I would expect from Unken's son.

00:21:30.550 --> 00:21:33.280
Oh my, the winner is Tenka's cat.

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:37.770
I guess I have no choice, I'll let you live in the apartment.

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:40.320
Oh my.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:43.550
Maybe we should have a party for you tonight.

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:47.000
Give us a break!

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
May tonight be...

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
今夜もしかして

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:56.260
konya moshikashite

